{"code":0,"data":{"title":"截图文件上传","content":"<h2 id=\"s-l5tr7gnt\">app.upload.screenshot</h2><p>功能描述：应用更新、创建或者游戏更新截图文件上传</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-42823221\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"412\" style=\"width: 412px\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"412\" style=\"width: 412px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-42780486\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"578\" style=\"width: 578px\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"578\" style=\"width: 578px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称 &nbsp; ：app.upload.screenshot</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" ro