3px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"578\" style=\"width: 578px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名的摘要算法，可选值为：hmac。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"578\" style=\"width: 578px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API输入参数签名结果，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/327#w1-84225273\">签名算法参照下面的介绍</a>。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target_app_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"578\" style=\"width: 578px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>被调用的目标key，可选值：developer</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-89606972\">请求参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191,113,578\" style=\"width: 882px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>POST</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191\" style=\"width: 191px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td colsp