"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"363\" style=\"width: 363px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回状态码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>subCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"363\" style=\"width: 363px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求子返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"363\" style=\"width: 363px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>信息描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"363\" style=\"width: 363px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传后的文件信息。上传失败时不返回此参数。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"363\" st